<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bankers Trust starts 5 cellulars.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bankers Trust starts 5 cellulars.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bankers Trust said it initiated coverage of five cellular companies.</p>
<p>-- said rates 360 Communications Co a strong buy and Vanguard Cellular Systems Inc a buy.</p>
<p>-- said gave Commnet Cellular Inc, Palmer Wireless Inc and AirTouch Communications Inc market perform ratings.  </p>
<p>-- set 360 Comms 12-month price target $28.</p>
<p>-- set Vanguard 12-month price target $19.</p>
<p>-- set CommNet 12-month price target $32.</p>
<p>-- set Palmer 12-month price target $14.</p>
<p>-- set AirTouch 12-month price target $31.</p>
</text>
